/// StringExtensionsHost — a helper class that works on `String` values.
/// Class-shape flavour: file whose class methods take a stdlib value
/// (`String`), the way to add behaviour to a class you do not own (ADR 0152).
Object subclass: StringExtensionsHost

  class label -> String => "string-extensions-host"

  class shoutLouder: text :: String => text uppercase ++ "!"

  class exclaim: text :: String with: suffix :: String -> String => text ++ "!" ++ suffix
